WEBVTT

00:08:00.134 --> 00:08:02.976
(Laughter)

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.429
Yeah, I walk around nightclubs
all night like this.

00:08:05.453 --> 00:08:07.915
(Laughter)

00:08:07.939 --> 00:08:09.993
You just take a seat
over here for a second.

00:08:10.017 --> 00:08:11.976
I'm going to use you again, in a moment.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.572
Can you take a seat
right over here, if you don't mind.

00:08:14.596 --> 00:08:15.747
Sit right here.
Man: OK.

00:08:16.469 --> 00:08:18.976
KB: OK, take a seat. Excellent, OK.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.976
Now, what I want you to do
is look directly at me, OK,

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.143
just take a deep breath
in through your nose,

00:08:24.167 --> 00:08:26.717
letting it out through
your mouth, and relax.

00:08:26.741 --> 00:08:30.459
Allow your eyes to close,
on five, four, three, two, one.